  "title": "Fidel Castro",
  "summary": "Fidel Castro was a Cuban revolutionary leader and statesman who ousted Fulgencio Batista in 1959, governing Cuba for nearly half a century as prime minister and president. He converted the island into a one-party socialist state closely aligned with the Soviet Union, withstanding decades of United States economic embargoes, CIA assassination plots, and the 1961 Bay of Pigs invasion. His rule oversaw major expansions in universal healthcare and literacy alongside strict suppression of political dissent.",
